index 60fa76c..23f4e7b 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -46,7 +46,7 @@ cloudflared tunnel --url http://127.0.0.1:3080
 
 The patch adds a centralized open-authority switch to the core connection transport and ApiProxy capability declaration. It propagates the server authority to the browser, keeps host-backed settings enabled for non-loopback callers, replaces the native configuration-file handoff with an in-page browser editor, and retains browser filesystem browsing for remote workspace selection.
 
-The active base composition no longer mounts the DeepSeek chat provider or its DeepSeek web-search companion. Their source packages remain untouched so an official checkout or custom overlay can re-enable them intentionally.
+The active base composition no longer mounts the DeepSeek chat provider or its DeepSeek web-search companion. Their source packages remain untouched so an official checkout or custom overlay can re-enable them intentionally. The default agent model selection points at the pi-ai multi-provider `deepseek` route (the same model family) instead of the removed official adapter, and in-process subagents inherit the parent session's live model route from the latest request header rather than the creation-time deployment default. A delegated child therefore follows the provider/model selected for the parent session instead of failing with "no adapter registered for provider 'deepseek-official'" when that adapter is absent.
 
 ## Documentation and patch contents
 
