+  <p>The exact change is in <code>patches/open-authority-web-only.patch</code>. The source baseline is pinned in <code>UPSTREAM-COMMIT.txt</code>. In-process subagents inherit the parent session's live model route, so delegation follows the provider selected in the browser rather than a stale <code>deepseek-official</code> default. If the official project changes enough for the patch not to apply, review the patch manually rather than forcing it over local work.</p>
